# REGLAS

[SCANNER_RULES]
RULES1 § usuario-colon § Detecta usuario: valor § (?i)(?:usuario|user(?:name)?)\s*[:=]\s*["'""]?([A-Za-z0-9_\-.@]{3,})["'""]? § High
RULES2 § contrasena-colon § Detecta contraseña: valor § (?i)(?:contraseña|password|pass|clave|pwd)\s*[:=]\s*["'""]?([A-Za-z0-9_\-.@#$%^&*!]{4,})["'""]? § High
RULES3 § user-pass-line § Detecta user:pass § (?i)user\s*[:=]\s*([^\s,;]{3,})\s*[,;]?\s*pass\s*[:=]\s*([^\s,;]{3,}) § High
RULES4 § u-c-line § Detecta u: X c: Y § (?i)\bu\s*[:=]\s*([A-Za-z0-9_\-.@]{3,})\s*[,;]?\s*c\s*[:=]\s*([A-Za-z0-9_\-.@#$%^&*!]{4,}) § High
RULES5 § password-quotes § Detecta password="valor" § password\s*=\s*["'""]([^""']{4,})["'""] § High
RULES6 § api-key § Detecta API Key § (?i)(?:api[_-]?key|apikey)\s*[:=]\s*["'""]?(sk_(?:live|test)_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,})["'""]? § High
RULES7 § token-jwt § Detecta Token JWT § eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_\-]+\.[A-Za-z0-9_\-]+\.[A-Za-z0-9_\-]+ § High
RULES8 § secret § Detecta Secret § (?i)(?:secret|client[_-]?secret)\s*[:=]\s*["'""]?([A-Za-z0-9_\-]{16,})["'""]? § High
RULES9 § ip-puerto § Detecta IP:Puerto § (?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}:\d{2,5} § High
#RULES10 § direccion-ip § Detecta dirección IP § (?i)direccion\s*(?:destino)?\s*[:=]\s*((?:\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}) § High
RULES11 § db-credenciales § Detecta credenciales DB § (?i)(?:base\s*de\s*datos|database|db)\s*[:=]\s*[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{3,} § High
RULES12 § git-user § Detecta usuario Git § usr_mi_[A-Za-z0-9_\-]{10,} § High
RULES13 § sql-grant § Detecta GRANT § (?i)GRANT\s+ALL\s+ON\s+PROCEDURE\s+[A-Za-z0-9_.]+\s+TO\s+[A-Za-z0-9_]+ § High

